---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookies policy" description="Information about cookies and local storage on the eduAssets website." locale="en" path="cookies-policy">
  <main class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Cookies policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 20, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2><p>The eduAssets institutional website does not use advertising, tracking, analytics, or third-party cookies.</p>
    <h2>Essential local storage</h2><p>When you change the visual theme, the site stores only the <code>eduassets-theme</code> preference in your browser’s local storage. No personal information is recorded.</p>
    <h2>Managing preferences</h2><p>You can remove this preference by clearing website data in your browser. Because this landing page has no optional cookies or trackers, no consent banner is required.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/">Back to the website</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
